As it stands, the island room isn't a special level type, it's a
special kind of room, that could appear multiple times in the dungeon,
or never.  So we can't put anything there the player could possibly
need to continue, because it might never appear.

> If it appears deeper than some level, or perhaps even between the
> quest and medusa, it gets created as the Lava Treasure Island, guarded
> by (singing) demons that have concealed some better prizes for the
> already advanced character.

The prize buried on the island is currently a normal chest, with
typical chest treasure, and a good quantity of gold depending on the
level.  I'm wondering if it needs more, or treasure other than the
gold.  I've considered one or two random, guarenteed-non-glass gems.

I'm reluctant to put actual, guarenteed magic items in the chest
because the player already finds most of the stuff he needs to ascend
before the Castle.

